Pass relevant independent correctness/security/performance checks and native acceptance through the repository cargo xtask/Nix workflow, using `cargo check` rather than `cargo build`, with warnings as errors. Isolate timed measurements from concurrent builds/development. Retain unchanged evidence; reopen only for an observed regression or explicitly changed requirement, with an owner and affected-consumer list. A planned later extension is its own package, not a claim that an earlier incomplete package was done.

